{\b\fs22 Xbox Control for SolidWorks}\par
\par
Move around SolidWorks models with an Xbox controller: orbit, move, zoom and switch views, all at once and with analog speed.\par
\par
{\b What gets installed}\par
\bullet  The Xbox Control add-in for SolidWorks (loads automatically when SolidWorks starts)\par
\bullet  Xbox Control Settings, for choosing what each button and stick does\par
\par
Installs for your Windows account only; no administrator rights needed. Remove it any time from Settings > Apps.\par
\par
{\b Requirements}\par
Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit), SolidWorks 2023 or newer, and an Xbox controller (USB or Bluetooth) or another XInput controller.\par
